### 1. **Logarithmic Function**
This graph shows a logarithmic function, highlighting its properties and behavior.

```latex
\begin{tikzpicture}
    \begin{axis}[
        axis lines = middle,
        xlabel = \(x\),
        ylabel = \(y\),
        xmin=0, xmax=10,
        ymin=-3, ymax=3,
        grid=both,
        grid style={line width=.1pt, draw=gray!10},
        major grid style={line width=.2pt,draw=gray!50},
